1
00:00:05,005 --> 00:00:07,008
THEME SONG: In the
not-too-distant future--

2
00:00:07,042 --> 00:00:13,080
next Sunday, AD-- there
was a guy named Joel,

3
00:00:13,113 --> 00:00:16,050
not too different
from you or me.

4
00:00:16,083 --> 00:00:20,788
He worked at Gizmonic
Institute, just another face

5
00:00:20,822 --> 00:00:22,590
