so they shot him into space.

8
00:00:32,133 --> 00:00:37,572
We'll send him cheesy movies,
the worst we can find.

9
00:00:37,605 --> 00:00:38,473
La la la.

10
00:00:38,507 --> 00:00:41,308
He'll have to sit
and watch them all,

11
00:00:41,342 --> 00:00:44,078
and we'll monitor his mind.

12
00:00:44,112 --> 00:00:44,945
La la la.

13
00:00:44,978 --> 00:00:47,315
Now keep in mind,
Joel can't control

14
00:00:47,348 --> 00:00:50,252
where the movies begin or end--

15
00:00:50,285 --> 00:00:51,152
La la la.

16
00:00:51,185 --> 00:00:53,855
--because he used
those special parts

17
00:00:53,888 --> 00:00:58,660
