back on, everybody.

40
00:01:42,470 --> 00:01:43,437
Wow.

41
00:01:43,472 --> 00:01:45,673
Check it out, welcome to
the Satellite of Love.

42
00:01:45,707 --> 00:01:48,308
We're just talking about
if we had our chance, what

43
00:01:48,342 --> 00:01:49,610
